README file
	for https://subversive.cims.nyu.edu/exact/corelib2/trunk/progs/ivp/ 

TO get to our SVN repository, use
		username=guest and password=guest

This folder contains our IVP project.  It has 3 subfolders:
	3) endCover2 software:
			This is our latest IVP software that
			extends the previous "endCover software" by
			incorporating the ideas in the paper
			"Taylor Tube Method for Validated IVP"
			Proc. 9th Intl. Congress on Mathematical Software (ICMS).
			Waterloo, Canada. 20-23 Jul 2026.
			https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.19068.  (Jul 2026)
	2) endCover software:
			This is the second software, and it extends the 
			"endEnclosure software" by computing an eps-end cover
			of given IVP(B_0,H,eps).  It is described in 
			"End Cover for Initial Value Problem:
				Complete Validated Algorithms with Complexity Analysis",
			http://arxiv.org/abs/2602.00162.  (Feb 2026)
	1) endEnclosure software:
			This is the first software in our IVP work,
			and is described in our paper
			"A Novel Approach to the Initial Value Problem
					with a Complete Validated Algorithm",
   			http://arxiv.org/abs/2502.00503.
			Jan 2025 (revised Jan 2026).

You can download the .zip files directly
Please contact us if you for any questions
or help in using this software!

-- Bingwei Zhang and Chee Yap
July 2026
